1
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:10,680
<i>So this is what love</i>
<i>at first sight feels like?</i>

2
00:00:11,320 --> 00:00:12,880
<i>Yeah, she really is cute.</i>

3
00:00:12,960 --> 00:00:14,960
Can I get your IG? My friend likes you.

4
00:00:15,800 --> 00:00:18,120
<i>What's it called when you</i>
<i>jump in to help without being asked?</i>

5
00:00:22,160 --> 00:00:24,680
<i>We just transferred here</i>
<i>and wanted to do a cultural exchange</i>

6
00:00:24,760 --> 00:00:25,640
<i>with students from other clubs.</i>

7
00:00:27,320 --> 00:00:30,120
<i>Dad, Mom, can I move into a condo?</i>

8
00:00:30,200 --> 00:00:32,640
<i>Alright. But there's one condition.</i>

9
00:00:32,720 --> 00:00:36,080
Yep, it's me. Your new roommate.

10
00:00:36,160 --> 00:00:37,400
ONE WEEK EARLIER

11
00:00:37,480 --> 00:00:38,440
I'm heading home first.

12
00:00:38,520 --> 00:00:40,360
That's Roll's job. Do you have Heal?

13
00:00:41,040 --> 00:00:42,880
Heal me. That's it.

14
00:00:46,320 --> 00:00:47,960
You're pushing too far.

15
00:00:54,760 --> 00:00:57,640
<i>Looks like FireStorm is starting to…</i>

16
00:00:57,720 --> 00:01:00,000
Ava, my headset. I'm about to win.

17
00:01:00,080 --> 00:01:01,560
- Hurry, give me my headset.
- Don't.

18
00:01:01,640 --> 00:01:03,040
- Give it to me.
- No.

19
00:01:04,400 --> 00:01:05,480
- My headset.
- Don't.

20
00:01:06,360 --> 00:01:07,400
Ava, my headset.

21
00:01:10,640 --> 00:01:11,920
Ava, my headset.

22
00:01:16,320 --> 00:01:17,520
No.

23
00:01:18,960 --> 00:01:20,400
Don't. Don't.

24
00:01:21,840 --> 00:01:23,000
Ava!

25
00:01:24,400 --> 00:01:26,760
I told you to come out.
Your brother's in the middle of a match.

26
00:01:26,840 --> 00:01:27,840
Come here.

27
00:01:30,320 --> 00:01:31,880
I'm sorry, Putter.

28
00:01:31,960 --> 00:01:33,120
I'll take her outside.

29
00:01:35,760 --> 00:01:39,440
<i>After Putter,</i>
<i>or FireStorm's Jaguar, went AFK,</i>

30
00:01:39,520 --> 00:01:41,960
<i>his team lost the advantage</i>
<i>and was defeated.</i>

31
00:01:42,040 --> 00:01:44,160
<i>They have sadly been eliminated.</i>

32
00:01:46,160 --> 00:01:47,680
I… ̀I'm sorry.

33
00:01:47,760 --> 00:01:50,160
You can compete again next time, okay?

34
00:01:51,360 --> 00:01:52,360
Okay.

35
00:01:53,040 --> 00:01:54,960
Let's go.

36
00:03:16,640 --> 00:03:20,600
Putter, I'm sorry. Come play with me.

37
00:03:20,680 --> 00:03:22,480
Please play with me?

38
00:03:23,160 --> 00:03:25,880
Putter, I'm sorry.

39
00:03:25,960 --> 00:03:27,680
Putter, I'm sorry.

40
00:03:27,760 --> 00:03:31,000
- Putter, I'm sorry I broke your headset.
- Ava.

41
00:03:31,080 --> 00:03:33,120
What are you doing in your brother's room?

42
00:03:33,200 --> 00:03:34,640
Come on. Come with me.

43
00:03:36,720 --> 00:03:38,080
I'll play with you.

44
00:03:40,080 --> 00:03:41,320
I'm sorry, sweetheart.

45
00:03:41,400 --> 00:03:42,840
Come on, let's go. You can play with me.

46
00:03:44,880 --> 00:03:46,640
Damn it.

47
00:03:51,720 --> 00:03:56,920
A DORM NEAR ME

48
00:03:57,000 --> 00:03:58,360
SPECIAL ROOM 70,000 BAHT/MONTH

49
00:04:03,400 --> 00:04:04,760
FULLY FURNISHED

50
00:04:04,840 --> 00:04:06,720
SOFT MATTRESS

51
00:04:06,800 --> 00:04:09,480
FULLY FURNISHED

52
00:04:25,960 --> 00:04:27,920
So, do you like it?

53
00:04:29,000 --> 00:04:31,280
I really do. This place is great.

54
00:04:34,520 --> 00:04:37,200
So if I pay today,
it's only 6,000 baht, right?

55
00:04:37,280 --> 00:04:39,000
That's right. It's 6,000 baht per person.

56
00:04:39,080 --> 00:04:40,440
Per person?

57
00:04:40,520 --> 00:04:42,040
Yes, 6,000 baht.

58
00:04:42,120 --> 00:04:44,200
If three people stay together,
it's really affordable.

59
00:05:05,520 --> 00:05:07,640
So, what do you think?

60
00:05:07,720 --> 00:05:09,120
It's 3,500 baht a month.

61
00:05:09,200 --> 00:05:10,920
It's the cheapest place around.

62
00:05:11,000 --> 00:05:12,960
It just needs a little renovation,
trust me.

63
00:05:13,040 --> 00:05:14,320
So, are you taking it?

64
00:05:15,440 --> 00:05:17,440
- That's more than just a little.
- It is.

65
00:05:17,520 --> 00:05:19,040
See? I'll replace the bed.

66
00:05:19,120 --> 00:05:21,640
And I'll change the sheets
and curtains too.

67
00:05:23,920 --> 00:05:25,680
So, are you booking the room?

68
00:05:27,000 --> 00:05:28,400
Let me think it over first.

69
00:05:28,480 --> 00:05:31,280
Damn it. Think it over? Damn.

70
00:05:43,480 --> 00:05:45,640
Is Bangkok just
full of scammers these days?

71
00:05:48,280 --> 00:05:50,920
Please help this country kid out.

72
00:05:51,000 --> 00:05:53,440
Please let me find a place
that's right for me.

73
00:06:22,560 --> 00:06:24,040
Hello.

74
00:06:24,120 --> 00:06:26,440
Is this dorm really 6,000 baht?

75
00:06:30,120 --> 00:06:31,240
Of course.

76
00:06:32,600 --> 00:06:33,640
Here.

77
00:06:40,000 --> 00:06:42,320
Thank you so much.
The price is really good.

78
00:06:42,960 --> 00:06:44,320
I understand.

79
00:06:44,400 --> 00:06:46,800
I don't want students like you
paying too much either.

80
00:06:55,840 --> 00:06:57,800
This next part isn't in the contract,

81
00:06:58,400 --> 00:07:02,200
but could we make a deal?

82
00:07:02,880 --> 00:07:03,760
What is it?

83
00:07:07,640 --> 00:07:10,760
I want you to keep an eye

84
00:07:12,360 --> 00:07:14,840
on your roommate
and report his behavior to me.

85
00:07:14,920 --> 00:07:16,400
He's my son.

86
00:07:16,480 --> 00:07:18,720
In return, your rent
will stay at 6,000 baht

87
00:07:19,400 --> 00:07:21,280
until you graduate.

88
00:07:25,080 --> 00:07:26,160
That's all?

89
00:07:26,760 --> 00:07:27,640
Sure.

90
00:07:29,080 --> 00:07:30,120
Okay.

91
00:07:33,440 --> 00:07:34,680
Done.

92
00:07:35,960 --> 00:07:37,360
Thank you.

93
00:07:38,320 --> 00:07:39,680
Well then,

94
00:07:39,760 --> 00:07:43,080
- I'll send you the payment slip.
- One second.

95
00:07:44,840 --> 00:07:47,360
May I see your phone wallpaper?

96
00:07:54,600 --> 00:07:57,520
The person you want me to keep tabs on is…

97
00:07:58,680 --> 00:07:59,600
LeeIth?

98
00:08:01,280 --> 00:08:02,760
You two know each other?

99
00:08:06,360 --> 00:08:08,840
Yeah. We know each other very well.

100
00:08:11,360 --> 00:08:13,520
I only asked a little,
but you told me the whole story.

101
00:08:13,600 --> 00:08:14,960
That's about it.

102
00:08:33,880 --> 00:08:35,120
You call this a room?

103
00:08:37,480 --> 00:08:38,520
Yeah.

104
00:08:39,120 --> 00:08:40,640
Besides reporting to my mom,

105
00:08:41,320 --> 00:08:42,880
are you gonna expose me on Twitter too?

106
00:08:42,960 --> 00:08:44,000
It's X now.

107
00:08:44,080 --> 00:08:45,120
Yeah, whatever.

108
00:08:46,320 --> 00:08:49,280
If you don't cause trouble,
I won't call you out.

109
00:08:50,680 --> 00:08:52,360
Have you been stalking me?

110
00:08:55,800 --> 00:08:57,160
You're way too full of yourself.

111
00:08:58,960 --> 00:09:02,160
I'm here because the rent is cheap.

112
00:09:03,720 --> 00:09:05,840
And are you sure you can live with me?

113
00:09:10,480 --> 00:09:13,440
Now I'm not so sure I can live with you.

114
00:09:16,040 --> 00:09:18,000
But I've already paid the deposit,

115
00:09:18,080 --> 00:09:20,600
so the one who has to leave isn't me.

116
00:09:26,440 --> 00:09:27,960
Then let's make a truce.

117
00:09:28,760 --> 00:09:29,960
What's the deal?

118
00:09:30,840 --> 00:09:32,400
We can live together,

119
00:09:32,480 --> 00:09:35,440
but only tell my mom the good stuff.

120
00:09:39,680 --> 00:09:42,360
Putting on an act?
That counts as fake news.

121
00:09:43,280 --> 00:09:44,680
Is that really so hard?

122
00:09:44,760 --> 00:09:47,600
Is behaving yourself really so hard?

123
00:09:53,960 --> 00:09:56,360
Hey. So you're not taking the deal?

124
00:09:56,920 --> 00:09:58,640
Then good luck living here.

125
00:10:03,800 --> 00:10:05,320
That's your room, right?

126
00:10:06,440 --> 00:10:07,440
Yeah.

127
00:10:08,520 --> 00:10:10,840
Then this is my room.

128
00:10:17,440 --> 00:10:18,880
Seriously though,

129
00:10:19,760 --> 00:10:21,600
why do you even have a gas station?

130
00:10:22,600 --> 00:10:24,360
Does your bike run on gas?

131
00:10:25,800 --> 00:10:27,040
Is the tank full?

132
00:10:36,480 --> 00:10:38,160
Honestly, I kinda ship you two.

133
00:10:39,560 --> 00:10:40,640
If Min finds out,

134
00:10:40,720 --> 00:10:42,240
you'll be the main characters
in her next fanfic.

135
00:10:42,320 --> 00:10:44,040
Don't even think about it.

136
00:10:44,120 --> 00:10:45,000
And don't tell anyone.

137
00:10:45,080 --> 00:10:47,720
Your roommate is a celebrity.

138
00:10:47,800 --> 00:10:49,480
Putter just went viral.

139
00:10:51,520 --> 00:10:53,120
The girls are crazy about him.

140
00:10:59,160 --> 00:11:00,640
<i>Hello.</i>

141
00:11:00,720 --> 00:11:03,280
<i>Do you have a type right now?</i>

142
00:11:03,880 --> 00:11:04,920
<i>No.</i>

143
00:11:05,000 --> 00:11:06,680
<i>Everyone, he doesn't have a type.</i>

144
00:11:06,760 --> 00:11:08,680
<i>So any kind of girl is fine with you?</i>

145
00:11:09,360 --> 00:11:11,200
Shit. Fifty thousand views.

146
00:11:11,280 --> 00:11:12,280
That went viral.

147
00:11:12,360 --> 00:11:14,080
Yeah, I'm coming over.

148
00:11:14,160 --> 00:11:15,240
<i>You're coming to kick him out, right?</i>

149
00:11:15,320 --> 00:11:16,640
Then get over here.

150
00:11:17,560 --> 00:11:20,320
I'm gonna make content with him
to gain followers so I can woo Faye.

151
00:11:20,400 --> 00:11:21,680
Asshole.

152
00:11:21,760 --> 00:11:23,280
I'm kidding.

153
00:11:23,360 --> 00:11:24,760
I know you mean it.

154
00:11:25,720 --> 00:11:29,080
<i>You're so cute. Do you have a crush?</i>

155
00:11:30,240 --> 00:11:31,520
<i>I'd rather not answer.</i>

156
00:11:31,600 --> 00:11:33,200
- He's so fake.
- <i>You'd rather not answer?</i>

157
00:11:33,280 --> 00:11:35,120
<i>If you won't answer,</i>

158
00:11:35,200 --> 00:11:37,800
- Damn, he's like a different person.
- <i>does that mean you have a crush?</i>

159
00:11:37,880 --> 00:11:39,200
Look how hooked you are.

160
00:11:39,280 --> 00:11:40,760
You've fallen for him.

161
00:11:40,840 --> 00:11:42,520
Did you forget you're on a call with me?

162
00:11:42,600 --> 00:11:44,400
Don't get carried away.

163
00:11:44,480 --> 00:11:45,680
I just forgot to close it.

164
00:11:45,760 --> 00:11:47,000
I'm off. I'm hanging up.

165
00:12:01,840 --> 00:12:02,800
What?

166
00:12:06,160 --> 00:12:07,880
What the hell is this?

167
00:12:13,480 --> 00:12:14,720
Shit.

168
00:12:15,480 --> 00:12:16,600
<i>What?</i>

169
00:12:16,680 --> 00:12:18,240
It hasn't even been a day,

170
00:12:18,320 --> 00:12:19,480
and he's already made rules.

171
00:12:19,560 --> 00:12:21,200
<i>Show me.</i>

172
00:12:22,080 --> 00:12:24,800
Here, look. I'll read them.

173
00:12:27,400 --> 00:12:28,800
Rule 1.

174
00:12:28,880 --> 00:12:31,160
Unless it's an emergency,
don't talk to me.

175
00:12:32,080 --> 00:12:35,440
Rule 2. Don't use other people's stuff
without permission.

176
00:12:35,520 --> 00:12:37,480
Rule 3. No smelly food.

177
00:12:37,560 --> 00:12:39,440
Rule 4. Don't make the room messy.

178
00:12:39,520 --> 00:12:41,760
Anything left on the floor counts as trash

179
00:12:41,840 --> 00:12:43,400
and will be thrown away without notice.

180
00:12:43,480 --> 00:12:45,160
You'd better watch yourself with that one.

181
00:12:45,240 --> 00:12:46,680
Shit.

182
00:12:53,600 --> 00:12:55,440
There's even a Rule 5.

183
00:12:55,520 --> 00:12:58,560
Alternate laundry days
by odd and even dates.

184
00:13:00,640 --> 00:13:01,760
I've had enough.

185
00:13:06,360 --> 00:13:07,200
What now?

186
00:13:11,000 --> 00:13:13,600
If you have a problem with any rule,

187
00:13:13,680 --> 00:13:15,600
take it to court.

188
00:13:15,680 --> 00:13:17,480
No notice required.

189
00:13:17,560 --> 00:13:19,000
From Putter.

190
00:13:25,560 --> 00:13:27,040
He's such a pain in the ass.

191
00:13:27,120 --> 00:13:29,160
No, damn it. It hurts.

192
00:13:31,920 --> 00:13:33,120
What should I do?

193
00:13:43,000 --> 00:13:45,160
So if it's not on the list, it's allowed?

194
00:13:45,240 --> 00:13:47,240
You free tonight, Indy?

195
00:13:47,320 --> 00:13:49,400
Let's have some fun, my friend.

196
00:13:55,040 --> 00:13:56,560
Hey, who's a noob?

197
00:13:56,640 --> 00:13:58,160
I just messed up that day.

198
00:13:58,720 --> 00:13:59,560
Come on.

199
00:13:59,640 --> 00:14:01,280
Let's have a rematch today.

200
00:14:01,360 --> 00:14:03,680
Plus, I've got a new room.

201
00:14:04,680 --> 00:14:05,880
Let's go, everyone.

202
00:14:22,520 --> 00:14:23,640
Oh, sorry.

203
00:14:23,720 --> 00:14:25,720
It's coming from the room next to mine.

204
00:14:42,640 --> 00:14:45,560
Damn it, I lost. Be right back.

205
00:14:48,360 --> 00:14:51,320
IF YOU HAVE A PROBLEM WITH ANY RULE,

206
00:14:51,400 --> 00:14:54,120
TAKE IT TO COURT.

207
00:14:54,200 --> 00:14:57,440
NO NOTICE REQUIRED.

208
00:14:57,520 --> 00:14:58,400
Hey.

209
00:14:59,720 --> 00:15:00,760
Sorry, Ter.

210
00:15:00,840 --> 00:15:02,520
LeeIth got a little carried away.

211
00:15:03,440 --> 00:15:05,160
Yeah, it's fine.

212
00:15:05,800 --> 00:15:06,880
Come join us.

213
00:15:06,960 --> 00:15:08,720
Sing with us. We're having fun rehearsing.

214
00:15:09,520 --> 00:15:11,920
I'm good. I'm rehearsing with my team too.

215
00:15:12,720 --> 00:15:14,400
Okay. Join us next time then.

216
00:15:14,480 --> 00:15:17,960
Anyway, could you keep it down a bit?

217
00:15:18,640 --> 00:15:19,640
Okay.

218
00:15:20,920 --> 00:15:23,440
Hey. You're not gonna yell at me?

219
00:15:24,040 --> 00:15:27,080
Why would I? I wasn't here to yell at you.

220
00:15:35,720 --> 00:15:36,720
What's with him?

221
00:15:36,800 --> 00:15:38,000
He won't yell at you,

222
00:15:38,080 --> 00:15:39,880
but I can't say the same
for your neighbors.

223
00:15:44,880 --> 00:15:45,920
Shit.

224
00:15:46,840 --> 00:15:47,960
The building management is calling.

225
00:15:48,040 --> 00:15:49,040
BUILDING MANAGEMENT

226
00:15:50,560 --> 00:15:51,880
Hello?

227
00:15:51,960 --> 00:15:55,000
Sorry, my neighbors are being noisy.

228
00:15:58,400 --> 00:16:00,520
Okay. I'll let them know.
Sorry about that.

229
00:16:05,880 --> 00:16:07,360
Damn.

230
00:16:07,440 --> 00:16:09,720
- Your hair looks amazing.
- Of course.

231
00:16:13,760 --> 00:16:15,040
Oh, right, Tungtae.

232
00:16:16,360 --> 00:16:18,120
I've already got a condo.

233
00:16:18,200 --> 00:16:21,520
Nice. More privacy, huh?

234
00:16:23,800 --> 00:16:24,800
Kind of.

235
00:16:24,880 --> 00:16:27,560
- But my roommate is…
- Tae.

236
00:16:27,640 --> 00:16:30,320
- Yes?
- Can you do my hair?

237
00:16:30,400 --> 00:16:31,720
Are you filming content?

238
00:16:31,800 --> 00:16:33,320
Sure.

239
00:16:35,560 --> 00:16:37,200
One, two, three.

240
00:16:41,040 --> 00:16:43,520
Putter, want to film with us?

241
00:16:43,600 --> 00:16:44,560
Yeah, come on, Ter.

242
00:16:44,640 --> 00:16:45,880
- Huh?
- Come film with us.

243
00:16:47,560 --> 00:16:49,720
Today, two handsome guys
are doing my hair.

244
00:16:50,640 --> 00:16:52,440
Let's see who can braid it better.

245
00:16:56,360 --> 00:16:57,200
That's all?

246
00:16:58,160 --> 00:16:59,160
Yep.

247
00:16:59,240 --> 00:17:02,040
Once we're done filming,
we can finish braiding it ourselves.

248
00:17:02,800 --> 00:17:04,000
It's okay.

249
00:17:04,079 --> 00:17:05,960
I'll braid it for you. I want to help.

250
00:17:09,440 --> 00:17:12,560
Oh, right.
So, how's the condo working out?

251
00:17:13,640 --> 00:17:14,960
Umm…

252
00:17:15,040 --> 00:17:16,280
Well…

253
00:17:16,800 --> 00:17:18,480
My roommate… turned out to be…

254
00:17:18,560 --> 00:17:20,160
Hey, LeeIth! Lee!

255
00:17:21,119 --> 00:17:22,119
Come here.

256
00:17:30,560 --> 00:17:31,760
Tae, what are you doing?

257
00:17:36,640 --> 00:17:37,760
I'm sorry.

258
00:17:43,680 --> 00:17:46,080
Putter's braids look really nice.

259
00:17:46,160 --> 00:17:47,640
They're not just plain braids.

260
00:17:48,400 --> 00:17:49,640
True.

261
00:17:49,720 --> 00:17:51,280
Where did you learn that?

262
00:17:51,360 --> 00:17:52,520
- Damn.
- Oh.

263
00:17:53,080 --> 00:17:55,720
My sisters always had me braid their hair.

264
00:17:57,080 --> 00:17:58,880
That's so sweet.

265
00:17:58,960 --> 00:18:00,360
You're awesome.

266
00:18:01,440 --> 00:18:03,640
Be right back. I'm going to grab the mic.

267
00:18:05,360 --> 00:18:06,360
Hi, buddy.

268
00:18:07,520 --> 00:18:08,520
Hey.

269
00:18:09,200 --> 00:18:10,720
Aren't you even going
to pay attention to your friend?

270
